flowchart TD
  A[Browser navigation] --> B[Content script]
  B --> C[Collect signal types and permission states]
  C --> D[Background service worker]
  D --> E{Safe Browsing key configured?}
  E -- Yes --> F[Google Safe Browsing URL lookup]
  E -- No --> G[Local heuristics only]
  F --> H[Risk verdict]
  G --> H
  H --> I{High risk?}
  I -- No --> J[Save visit locally]
  I -- Yes --> K[In-page warning]
  K --> L{User decision}
  L -- Leave --> M[No incident]
  L -- Continue --> N[Save unresolved incident locally]
  N --> O[Popup and local dashboard]
  N --> P{Email alerts enabled and relay configured?}
  P -- No --> O
  P -- Yes --> Q[Local retry queue]
  Q --> R[HTTPS email relay when online]
  R --> S[Email delivery handled by configured relay]
